        Phishing, fake login pages, password spraying, MFA abuse, stolen tokens, OAuth abuse, vendor impersonation.

    Scenario 3 — Ransomware / Access Broker Intrusion
        Stolen credentials, exposed remote services, exploitation, lateral movement, data theft, encryption, extortion.

