    Scenario 5 — Third-Party / Supply-Chain Compromise
        Vendor access, contractor accounts, trusted integrations, shared services, software/service-provider compromise.

    Scenario 6 — Public Disruption / Defacement / DDoS (only if relevant)
        Public website disruption, hacktivism, defacement, denial-of-service, or public-service interruption.

