For each PIR, collect enough information to answer:

• Who is involved?
• What is happening?
• When did it begin or become relevant?
• Where is the threat, asset, infrastructure, or exposure?
• Why does it matter to us?
• How could it affect us?
• What action should be taken?
• Who owns that action?

