RECOMMENDED FIRST PILOT
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

Use Case: Actively Exploited Vulnerability Affecting a High-Priority Technology

    Receive threat signal.

    Confirm the vulnerability or exploit information is credible and relevant.

    Identify the affected product, version, and attack conditions.

    Check authoritative internal inventory sources.

    Determine whether the organization uses the technology.

    Identify affected assets, exposure status, and owners.

    Send an actionable alert to Vulnerability Management / Engineering.

    Send hunt or investigation context to Incident Response if exploitation risk warrants it.

    Track remediation, mitigation, validation, or accepted risk.

    Record the outcome and stakeholder feedback.

