Minimum Viable CTI Workflow

☐ A stakeholder / action-owner map exists.

☐ Three to five PIRs are documented.

☐ A critical technology / asset watchlist exists.

☐ Five or fewer threat scenarios are prioritized.

☐ One threat signal is taken through:
Signal → relevance → affected check → owner → action → closure

☐ Feedback is collected and the workflow is improved.
